          "page": 10,
          "tasks": [
            {
              "id": "wu1-t1",
              "type": "gap-fill",
              "title": "Plural endings",
              "instruction": "Complete the spelling rules.",
              "text": "1. To make the plural of most nouns we add ___. 2. If the noun ends in -s, -sh, -ch, -z or -x, we add ___. 3. If it ends in consonant + -y, change -y to ___. 4. If it ends in -f or -fe, we often change it to ___.",
              "blanks": [
                {
                  "answers": [
                    "s",
                    "-s"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "answers": [
                    "es",
                    "-es"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "answers": [
                    "ies",
                    "-ies"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "answers": [
                    "ves",
                    "-ves"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "wu1-t2",
              "type": "multiple-choice",
              "title": "Irregular plural",
              "instruction": "The plural of 'knife' is:",
              "options": [
                "knifes",
                "knives",
                "knivez"
              ],
              "answerIndex": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "wu1-t3",
              "type": "find-and-click",
              "title": "Uncountable nouns",
